motions.motion_text:
BE IT RESOLVED THAT the Ottawa Board of Health receive the verbal update regarding the Ottawa Board of Health Education Session, which was held on January 26, 2024 as information;
AND THAT the Chair and Vice-Chair of the Ottawa Board of Health and Medical Officer of Health continue to engage with representatives from the Ministry of Health, neighbouring boards of health and the Association of Municipalities Ontario with respect to voluntary mergers and explore opportunities for alternative service delivery models with neighbouring health units to strengthen local public health practice;
AND THAT the Chair of the Ottawa Board of Health direct the Medical Officer of Health to provide an update to the Chief Medical Officer of Health and the office of the Minister of Health on the due diligence conducted to explore possible merger scenarios by the deadline of April 2, 2024, reflecting the Board’s preferred approach to maintain its existing boundaries and governance structure with the City of Ottawa;
AND THAT the Chair send a letter with a copy of this motion to the offices of the Minister of Health and the Chief Medical Officer of Health and copy the Mayor of the City of Ottawa and City Councillors, the City Manager and the Chairs of the Boards of Health of neighboring health units, advising of the Ottawa Board of Health’s preferred approach to maintain its existing boundaries and governance structure within the City of Ottawa;
AND FURTHERMORE THAT, the Chair of the Ottawa Board of Health report back to the Board on this matter at future meetings.
